{"title":"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Omega_Learn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Omega Learn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />, we can form five-letter \"words\". If these \"words\" are arranged in alphabetical order, then the \"word\" <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/f/39ff923e346c14334b1c7cfdcee7d47f9cadf18e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$USAMO$\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> occupies position\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/4094f025ce01ab6d611511649fe889425fb54882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 112\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 113\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 114\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 115\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 116$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"432\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/5/cc5ef4c011af453a9438ece8938f94c195af751b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4!\\cdot 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> \"words\" beginning with each of the first four letters alphabetically. From there, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f2dfeedc22ea0ff2877c9f98e571f73e2fc315e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3!\\cdot 3$\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" /> as the first letter and each of the first three letters alphabetically. After that, the next \"word\" is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/f/39ff923e346c14334b1c7cfdcee7d47f9cadf18e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$USAMO$\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, hence our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/5/935a614f719071855449cd2967d9481c8bc5b6f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\cdot 4!+3\\cdot 3!+1=\\boxed{115\\Rightarrow\\text{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"243\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da3d600d21b2b1343040ecb85db0e354a60e96a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/e/21e5206723f0ab8c3e17442ed4b794a3863f1c07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = 2$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7de7ec3025a041bfade85fb2069573996150cc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O = 3$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/e/51e60b61d5ced17fa0164ca18c4ef2fd703f478d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/9/709f6dffa4dea44cc417f27a36c2934cb07563ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U = 5$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />. The ways the numbers can be arranged is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> factorial which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/7/70721c830aa84eadb8417a0352d5ae02ead8d5bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12345$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> in spot <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104ffa745a68834e8cbf2a237fdee9e49613a1e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54321$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> in spot <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. Then counting backwards, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0dae02d9625ca1d7de2a008e989fc9feeea3b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54321, 54312, 54231, 54213, 54132, 54123$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"315\" height=\"17\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/8/788271465669af4cb58b6ec5f8a3b61db0ffb7ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{115\\Rightarrow\\text{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"93\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Omega_Learn\">Video Solution by Omega Learn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Omega Learn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RldWnL4-BfI?t=676\">https://youtu.be/RldWnL4-BfI?t=676</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B\">2002 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-r